WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.078 --> 00:00:02.983
WE ARE CAREFULLY AND SLOWLY

00:00:02.985 --> 00:00:04.120
BASED ON THE INFORMATION THAT

00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:05.367
COMES TO US.

00:00:05.401 --> 00:00:06.648
&gt;&gt; Dana: FOLLOWING IT CLOSELY

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:07.355
INDEED.

00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:10.037
CDC A POSITIVE ON THE PANDEMIC

00:00:10.038 --> 00:00:11.551
IN FEWER DEATHS IN THE COMING

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:12.418
WEEKS.

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:16.747
THE AGENCY SAYS IT COULD FALL TO

00:00:16.782 --> 00:00:18.925
3200 BY APRIL 10TH.

00:00:18.927 --> 00:00:21.718
DR. MARTY MAKARY, JOHN HOPKINS

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:24.679
SCHOOL OF POLICY.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.959
SO I’M SORRY, ABOUT A MONTH AGO

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:28.711
THAT YOU WROTE

00:00:28.745 --> 00:00:30.231
"WALL STREET JOURNAL" OP ED AND

00:00:30.265 --> 00:00:31.264
GOT A BUNCH OF CRITICISM.

00:00:31.266 --> 00:00:33.752
DO YOU FEEL A LITTLE VINDICATION

00:00:33.754 --> 00:00:34.986
THIS MORNING?

00:00:35.021 --> 00:00:37.423
&gt;&gt; LOOK, I’M NOT LOOKING TO WIN

00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:38.423
AN ARGUMENT.

00:00:38.424 --> 00:00:40.279
I DON’T THINK THOSE PEOPLE WILL

00:00:40.281 --> 00:00:41.411
APOLOGIZE WHEN THEY SHOW IT IS

00:00:41.446 --> 00:00:41.944
CORRECT.

00:00:41.979 --> 00:00:44.378
YOU CAN ONLY HAVE MODELS THAT

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:45.591
PREDICT THINGS FAR WORSE THAN

00:00:45.592 --> 00:00:46.531
REALITY.

00:00:46.532 --> 00:00:48.941
IF YOU PREDICT AND ACCURATE

00:00:48.942 --> 00:00:49.485
MODEL.

00:00:49.487 --> 00:00:51.761
BUT THE PROJECTION GAVE PEOPLE A

00:00:51.762 --> 00:00:52.720
FALSE SENSE OF SECURITY.

00:00:52.721 --> 00:00:53.766
I THINK IT ACTUALLY ENCOURAGED

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:55.737
PEOPLE TO DO WHAT THEY NEED TO

00:00:55.739 --> 00:00:57.151
DO UNTIL WE GET TO THAT POINT

00:00:57.186 --> 00:00:58.790
BECAUSE HOPE IS ON THE WAY.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:00:59.760
I THINK THE NUMBERS ARE POINTING

00:00:59.794 --> 00:01:00.667
THAT WAY.

00:01:00.668 --> 00:01:04.244
&gt;&gt; Dana: SO THE NUMBERS COME

00:01:04.245 --> 00:01:08.338
AT THE KAY’S IS DROPPING, SEVEN

00:01:08.373 --> 00:01:09.622
DAY MOVING AVERAGE FROM

00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:11.896
JANUARY 21 WITH 250,000 AND

00:01:11.898 --> 00:01:13.753
MARCHED DOWN TO 50,000.

00:01:13.754 --> 00:01:15.795
SO YOU THINK IT HAS SOME TO DO

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:17.962
WITH HERD IMMUNITY AND VACCINES.

00:01:17.996 --> 00:01:20.272
CAN YOU EXPLAIN?

00:01:20.273 --> 00:01:23.028
&gt;&gt; FIRST OF ALL, HERD IMMUNITY

00:01:23.029 --> 00:01:24.263
IS SIGNIFICANTLY SLOWING.

00:01:24.297 --> 00:01:26.388
IT’S NOT A HARD CUT OFF BUT IT’S

00:01:26.423 --> 00:01:27.185
BEEN KICKING IN.

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:29.633
WE ALREADY HAVE HERD IMMUNITY

00:01:29.635 --> 00:01:31.088
FOR THE NATION’S 23 MILLION

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.175
HEALTH CARE WORKERS.

00:01:32.176 --> 00:01:34.142
MOST OF THEM VACCINATED AND SOME

00:01:34.143 --> 00:01:35.419
OTHERS WHO HAVEN’T ALREADY HAVE

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.496
NATURAL IMMUNITY FROM PRIOR

00:01:36.497 --> 00:01:36.950
INFECTION.

00:01:36.951 --> 00:01:39.470
WE ARE A WEEK OR TWO AWAY FROM

00:01:39.504 --> 00:01:40.528
HERD IMMUNITY IN THE NURSING

00:01:40.563 --> 00:01:41.276
HOMES.

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:44.627
CASES ARE DOWN 98%.

00:01:44.662 --> 00:01:47.158
TEN STATES HAVE HAD DAYS WITH

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:47.903
ZERO DEATHS.

00:01:47.938 --> 00:01:49.597
WHAT DO YOU CALL THAT?

00:01:49.632 --> 00:01:51.641
I CALLED AT HERD IMMUNITY.

00:01:51.642 --> 00:01:52.934
WE WILL SEE HERD IMMUNITY ACROSS

00:01:52.935 --> 00:01:55.167
THE STREET IN APRIL AND MAY.

00:01:55.168 --> 00:01:56.694
THAT IS PART OF THE DIFFERENCE

00:01:56.728 --> 00:01:57.640
IN VACCINATION RATES.

00:01:57.641 --> 00:01:59.108
BUT WE ARE SEEING SOME REALLY

00:01:59.143 --> 00:02:00.021
GOOD NEWS.

00:02:00.055 --> 00:02:01.686
I DON’T THINK WE WILL EXTINGUISH

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.557
THIS FIRE AS I WROTE IN THAT

00:02:03.591 --> 00:02:03.782
PIECE.

00:02:03.817 --> 00:02:06.647
WE WILL SEE CASES LINGER ABOUT

00:02:06.648 --> 00:02:09.432
THE DEBATE IS "WHO ARE THOSE

00:02:09.433 --> 00:02:09.940
PEOPLE?"

00:02:09.941 --> 00:02:12.135
AND THOSE ARE YOUNG PEOPLE WITH

00:02:12.136 --> 00:02:13.633
ASYMPTOMATIC AND MILD DISEASE.

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:14.679
THEY COULD LINGER THROUGH MAY

00:02:14.713 --> 00:02:15.537
AND EARLY JUNE.

00:02:15.571 --> 00:02:17.438
&gt;&gt; Dana: WHAT DO YOU THINK, IS

00:02:17.439 --> 00:02:20.060
AT THE NEXT BIG ARGUMENT OR WHAT

00:02:20.094 --> 00:02:23.155
IS THE NEXT BIG ARGUMENT?

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:24.914
&gt;&gt; THERE WAS AN ARTICLE IN

00:02:24.948 --> 00:02:25.991
"THE NEW YORK TIMES" THAT

00:02:26.025 --> 00:02:27.040
CONSERVATIVES UNDERSTATE THE

00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:28.099
RISK.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.844
DEMOCRATS EXAGGERATE THE RISK.

00:02:29.878 --> 00:02:33.085
AND THEY DID A SURVEY SHOWING

00:02:33.087 --> 00:02:34.588
DEMOCRATS BELIEVE ABOUT 20% OF

00:02:34.589 --> 00:02:35.667
COVID PATIENTS ARE HOSPITALIZED.

00:02:35.702 --> 00:02:37.121
NOT TRUE, ABOUT 1%.

00:02:37.155 --> 00:02:39.436
SO WHAT YOU WILL SEE IS THIS

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:41.610
ARGUMENT WHEN THEY ARE CASES IN

00:02:41.644 --> 00:02:43.392
MAY, SOME WITH THE PANDEMIC TO

00:02:43.427 --> 00:02:44.902
KEEP GOING IT WILL SAY THAT IS

00:02:44.903 --> 00:02:45.927
SIGNIFICANT PUBLIC HEALTH RISK

00:02:45.961 --> 00:02:47.871
AND IT CAN SURGE AGAIN.

00:02:47.905 --> 00:02:49.996
BUT THE TRUTH IS THOSE ARE

00:02:50.031 --> 00:02:52.178
YOUNG, ASYMPTOMATIC CASES AND

00:02:52.212 --> 00:02:53.819
THEY WILL NOT SEARCH BECAUSE

00:02:53.854 --> 00:02:55.711
FEWER, SUSCEPTIBLE PEOPLE OUT

00:02:55.713 --> 00:02:56.170
THERE.

00:02:56.171 --> 00:02:58.092
THERE WAS A LOT OF VACCINATED

00:02:58.094 --> 00:02:59.076
NATURAL IMMUNITY.

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:00.414
&gt;&gt; Dana: YOU DEMAND PEOPLE

00:03:00.415 --> 00:03:01.282
DELAY THEIR SECOND DOSE?

00:03:01.317 --> 00:03:03.202
&gt;&gt; THAT IS RIGHT.

00:03:03.203 --> 00:03:06.036
WE CAN SAVE MORE LIVES IF PEOPLE

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:06.187
DELAYED THE SECOND DOSE.

